results/evaluation/test_subset_2500/labels/
results/evaluation/test_subset_2500/coco_eval/coco_predictions.json
results/evaluation/test_subset_2500/predictions.json
results/evaluation/test_subset_2500/yolov5s_coco20k_best_predictions.json

